        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana 88HS24, 88 Solid Brass 24\" Hotel Towel Shelf</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMade out of solid brass, this hotel towel shelf is built to last with the quality that Deltana is known for. An affordable and modern storage option, this wall mounted shelf is perfect for keeping extra towels within reach of the tub and at 24\" in length, it is large enough to hold even the most plush towels. It is available in two modern finishes for a clean, contemporary look including polished chrome and satin nickel.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-88HS24-specifications.gif?v=1704354739\" width=\"591\" height=\"345\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana 88HS24 24\" Hotel Shelf Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/20-inch-88-series-hotel-towel-shelf-deltana-88hs20\"><b>20\" 88 Series Hotel Shelf</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nShop more of the <a href=\"/search?type=product&q=Deltana 88 Series\"><b>Deltana 88 Series Bathroom Accessories</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the 88 Solid Brass 24 Inch Hotel Shelf Bracket:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 25-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Wall Mount Diameter: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Projection: 10-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection From Wall to Bar: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-88HS24.pdf?v=1691095386\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana 88HS24 24\" Hotel Shelf Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold Individually.</b> Package includes: 1 shelf bracket, mounting screw cover, and all necessary mounting screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>This is a Limited Series. <b>Limited Quantities Available</b></i>\r\n</p>",
